{"ref":"BDB, זָמִיר","hw":"זָמִיר","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">זָמִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a></sup> <strong>song (</strong>cf. Ba<sup>NB 136</sup><strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:10\" href=\"/Job.35.10\">Jb 35:10</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.1\">2 S 23:1</a>;—<em>song</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נְעִים זְמִרוֹת ישׂראל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.1\">2 S 23:1</a> in epith. of David; <a data-ref=\"Job 35:10\" href=\"/Job.35.10\">Jb 35:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.16\">Is 24:16</a>; of (hostile) song of triumph <span dir=\"rtl\">זְמִיר עָרִיצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">Is 25:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאוֹן זָרִים</span>); song in praise of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳ בִּזְמִרוֹת נָרִיעָה לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 95:2\" href=\"/Psalms.95.2\">ψ 95:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תודה</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ היו לי חֻקֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:54\" href=\"/Psalms.119.54\">119:54</a>, i.e. they are the subject of my song.—On <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.12\">Ct 2:12</a> v. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָמִיר²\" href=\"/BDB,_זָמִיר²\", dir=\"rtl\">זמיר</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, זָמַר\" href=\"/BDB,_זָמַר\", dir=\"rtl\">II. זמר</a>.","next":"BDB, מִזְמוֹר","prev":"BDB, זִמְרָת"}